<title>UK: Thorn unit sets 100 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Thorn unit sets 100 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THORN FINANCE PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  THORN PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    03.SEP.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    03.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
